## Visible Boundaries & Default Exclusions

- **Truthful Unavailability**: Missing workflow prerequisites (such as language server binaries, interactive question handlers, or external trackers) must be reported as unavailable before entering that workflow. They are never silently installed, and absent capabilities must never be claimed.
- **Independence & Clean Environment**: This reference preset is completely optional. It does not modify personal settings, live Perfect Pi environments, or global credentials.
- **No Heavy Defaults**: No default SoL-Pi, browser, web search, subagent execution framework, tmux orchestrator, or full toolchain dependencies are introduced.
